# The published extension carries the grammars, the snippets, the language
# configuration and its documentation. Everything below serves development.

.github/**
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
.gitignore
.vscodeignore

# Test harness: the fixtures, and the third-party grammars vendored so the
# embedded-language assertions resolve their scopes.
tests/**
test-bench/**
corpus/**
reader-signals/**
run_tests.sh
grammars.sh
tools/**

# The operator surface. A wiki the tooling reads and an operator edits, which the editor never
# loads — the grammar carries what the wiki says, projected ahead of the packaging step.
editions/**

# Agent and worktree scratch. A Claude Code session puts a git worktree under `.claude/worktrees/`,
# and a sibling checkout there weighs over a hundred megabytes. Nothing packed it by intent: it
# packed because nothing said otherwise, and it then SILENCED the guard that would have caught it —
# `vsce ls` wrote 1 242 041 bytes, past `execFileSync`'s 1 MB default, and the invariant reading
# that listing took the overflow for "vsce unavailable" and skipped.
.claude/**
.worktrees/**

# Research prose and the release ledger: archaeology a reader of this repository wants and a user of
# the extension never opens. The record a user does want stands at the root — the readme, the
# changelog, MIGRATION for the scope renames and SCOPE-NAMES for a theme author.
docs/**
LEDGER-*.md

# The attic holds a retired sketch no contribution registers.
syntaxes/attic/**

# Resolved from package.json at install time.
node_modules/**
package-lock.json

*.vsix
